Inventory list



GET /inventory



Filters: search, category, low stock badge via isLowStock





Inventory form



POST/PATCH /inventory



Fields for stock dims + price row (price, sale, currency); image picker





Adjust stock



POST .../adjust-stock



+/- stepper, reason optional





Categories



GET /inventory/categories



Load once; cache codes → labels





Product kit



POST /products/create-product



Pick inventory lines + per-line qty; separate kit selling price

Dart models: mirror inventory JSON including virtuals totalAvailableQuantity, effectivePrice, isLowStock. Use http or dio with MultipartRequest for create/update.

7. Error handling and edge cases





Standard error: { "success": false, "message": "..." } with 4xx/5xx



409 on checkout if inventory insufficient (store app; admin should prevent via low-stock list)



Legacy inventory rows without price: document that updates may fail until price/currency set in DB



Category seed: superadmin only; document Render/production seed via API if local Mongo unreachable

8. Environment





Base URL: {HOST}/api/v1 (e.g. Render UAT URL from env.uat if applicable)



Swagger: {HOST}/api-docs ([src/config/swagger.js](src/config/swagger.js) — InventoryItem schema includes pricing)
